        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion TB-D9, Ornate Bella Villa Mount Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Oval Floral Towel Bar is perfect for adding a little glamour to your bathroom. Choose from 3 lengths: 18 inches, 24 inches, and 30 inches. Made by Fusion, the Bella Villa Towel Bar is available in 6 finishes including oil rubbed bronze, polished brass, and antique copper.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/oval-floral-mount-hand-towel-ring-fusion-tr-d9\"><b>Fusion TR-D9 Traditional Round Mount Towel Ring</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/oval-floral-mount-robe-hook-fusion-rh-d9\"><b>Fusion RH-D9 Traditional Round Mount Robe Hook</b></a>, and\r\n<a href=\"/products/oval-floral-mount-toilet-paper-holder-fusion-ph-d9\"><b>Fusion PH-D9 Traditional Round Mount Toilet Paper Holder</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>TB-1-D9</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-2-D9</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-3-D9</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
